.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The Wishart (Laguerre) ensembles LOE (\beta=1), LUE (\beta=2), and LSE (\beta=4) are built from the sample covariance matrix W = X X^\dagger of an n \times m Gaussian data matrix X (n variables, m samples, m \geq n), with real, complex, or quaternionic entries respectively. The relevant control parameter is the aspect ratio \gamma = n/m \in (0, 1].">

