.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="GOE (\beta=1), GUE (\beta=2), and GSE (\beta=4) are the Gaussian random matrix ensembles built from real symmetric, complex Hermitian, and quaternionic self-dual Hermitian matrices respectively, with independent Gaussian entries. After rescaling eigenvalues by \sqrt{n\beta} (n the matrix size), the empirical spectral density of all three ensembles converges, as n \to \infty, to Wigner&#x27;s semicircle law on [-R, R] (R=2 here):">

